    "text": "The volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> aqueous <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HBr</mi></math> required to neutralize <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> aqueous <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ba</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is (Assume complete neutralization)"
